  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    name: Footplate
    detail: 'The footplate is the flat, oval base of the stapes that fits into the
      oval window (fenestra vestibuli) of the medial wall of the middle ear.

      It
      is held in position by the annular ligament, which secures it to the margin
      of the oval window.'
